name: Omen Globe — spectral in arcana packs
author: corpus
description: >-
  Omen Globe gives Spectral cards a chance to appear in Arcana Packs. First-shop spectral
  engine: pair with The Soul, Black Hole, and Perkeo.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: OmenGlobe
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - spectralCard: TheSoul
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - spectralCard: BlackHole
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Perkeo
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
